Write Possible Test Scenarios (Positive and Negative) for website https://petstore.octoperf.com/actions/Catalog.action
Positive Test Scenarios:
Verify that the user can open the PetStore website successfully.
Verify that the user can navigate to different pet categories.
Verify that the user can select a product from a category.
Verify that the user can view product details.
Verify that the user can search for a product using a valid keyword.
Verify that the user can add a product to the shopping cart.
Verify that the user can update the quantity of a product in the cart.
Verify that the user can remove a product from the cart.
Verify that the registered user can login with valid username and password.
Verify that the user can proceed to checkout with products in the cart.
Verify that the user can enter valid payment and shipping information.
Verify that the user can place an order successfully.
Verify that the user can sign out successfully.
Verify that the user can review order information after placing an order.
Negative Test Scenarios:
Verify that login fails when the username is invalid.
Verify that login fails when the password is invalid.
Verify that login validation works when username and password are left empty.
Verify that search shows an appropriate message when no keyword is entered.
Verify that search handles a keyword for which no product exists.
Verify that the user cannot proceed to checkout when the shopping cart is empty.
Verify that the system validates invalid payment card details.
Verify that the system validates an invalid expiry date during payment.
Verify that invalid characters are rejected in phone and ZIP code fields.
Verify that the system handles a quantity greater than the available stock correctly.
Verify that an out-of-stock item cannot be ordered successfully.
Verify that the user cannot complete checkout with required fields left empty.
